# Route: guide 39 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 61 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Swamp of Sorrows, Thunder Bluff, Dustwallow Marsh, Stonetalon
# Mountains, Tirisfal Glades, Alterac Mountains, The Hinterlands):
# Splinterspear Junction -> Stagalbog -> Misty Reed Strand -> Splinterspear
# Junction -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> The
# Quagmire -> The Den of Flame -> The Quagmire -> Windshear Crag -> Sun Rock
# Retreat -> Webwinder Path -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40); Arikara (5088; Arikara
# 28); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun
# the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); Earthen Arise (6481; Goggeroc 20);
# The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge Mauler 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen
# (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723), Tiara of
# the Deep (2846), Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), Heart of Disruption (96984),
# The Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987), Jammal'an the
# Prophet (1446).

